WEBVTT

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:12.140
A long time ago, the birdman who traveled
through the stars flew above the ocean.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:20.320
The fishman, in awe and fear of the birdman's grand wings, said this to the birdman:

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.920
"You may be able to fly, but you do not know how deep the ocean is."

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:30.870
"How sad and pitiful," he laughed.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:37.140
The birdman was angered by this and cut
off the tail and fins of the fishman.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.880
From the wounds, legs grew. This is how
the first human, Rooy Kanu, was born.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.950
Chapter Two

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.950
The Stars on the Earth

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:58.910
<i>Major...!</i>

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:02.110
Beta Three, calm down! Can you get to the Asuka?

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:04.000
<i>Yes, I think I can...</i>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.170
What?

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.470
That's...

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:12.930
Focker.

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:16.640
Instructor Ivanov... He's alive?

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:19.250
That fledgling...

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:39.270
Rooy Kanu went on a journey using a boat.

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:42.750
At the time, there was no land.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.590
God of Wind, please protect us.

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:54.660
Birdman, please abate your anger.

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:59.220
Rooy Kanu became thirsty, and began to cry bitterly.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:08.090
"I am such an unfortunate man. I am thirsty, yet
I have no fountains to moisten my throat."

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:31.130
How stupid.

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:34.740
There you are!

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:44.640
What?

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.270
Fuel's out. Let's meet again.

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:28.650
What?!

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:39.950
Then, the birdman dropped a sea turtle for him.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.990
The sea turtle collided with a rock and broke up into many pieces.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:47.000
Its shell became the island of Mayan.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:50.750
And the other fragments that shattered
all over the place became the surrounding islands.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:55.330
A new-type? Doesn't the damn UN Force has better prey for us?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:58.260
Not good enough!

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:00.010
Let's go.

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:13.680
Stubborn weakling.

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:21.360
Mao!

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.450
Are you okay?!

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.700
What? Shin?

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.440
Did you come to help me?

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:29.870
Get down!

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:49.350
I lost him...

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:10.960
Shin...?

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:20.790
Shin!

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:53.900
What?

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:56.990
Still not dead?

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.020
Die.

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:22.780
You're not getting away...

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:23.900
Shin!

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:30.200
After Rooy Kanu made it to this island, he cried bitterly.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:38.170
"I am such an unfortunate man. I must live here alone."

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.460
"I do not have a wife to share my happiness and sadness with."

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:47.750
Then, the birdman came down and cut his own head off.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:53.180
The blood that poured from his neck became a female, Rooy Waka.

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:58.260
Rooy Kanu and Rooy Waka joined together
and gave birth to many children.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:06.570
After giving birth to their children, Rooy Waka left and returned home to the stars, which was far across the ocean.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.870
"My dear wife, please come back to me."

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.910
The birdman replied and said,

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:16.610
"My dear husband Rooy Kanu..."

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:22.120
"The day I come back again will be when
the destiny of the stars crumbles."

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:26.450
"It is the day the song of destruction will echo into the world."

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:29.180
Shin! Wake up!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:30.680
Shin!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:36.390
Mao...

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:04.570
<i>This is AFOS, the relic from the aliens?</i>

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:08.090
<i>Although it is a relic, it is just a piece of it.</i>

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:10.590
<i>Its PCS response is weak.</i>

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:13.680
<i>So that means we'll have to look for a bigger piece.</i>

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:17.300
<i>No, this thing might be smaller than we think.</i>

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:22.680
<i>Look, the part from the neck upwards seems to have been cut off.</i>

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.690
<i>So someone buried it after breaking it into pieces?</i>

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:31.700
<i>A long time ago in Japan, they broke clay dolls into pieces and buried them.</i>

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:37.450
<i>But this guy existed when the brain capacity of a human was only 1200 cc.</i>

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:41.500
<i>There's too much of a time difference to compare
it to what the Japanese did a long time ago.</i>

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.320
<i>It may seem like it's far apart, but it could be closer than we think.</i>

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:48.990
<i>Are you referring to Professor Hasford's proto-culture theory again...?</i>

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:53.970
<i>That some sort of external factor accelerated the evolution of humanity.</i>

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.560
<i>Isn't it natural to think of it that way?</i>

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:00.100
<i>The speed of evolution was too fast.</i>

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:04.470
<i>But how is it possible to evolve all of humanity at once?</i>

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.280
<i>Have you heard of the Virus Evolution Theory?</i>

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:08.990
<i>Yes.</i>

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:13.600
<i>The one where viruses carried the genes, right?</i>

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:18.700
<i>A giraffe's neck didn't become long because
it wanted to eat leaves from a tall tree...</i>

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.830
<i>But because it got infected with a disease that made its neck longer.</i>

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.090
<i>But that doesn't justify Professor Hasford's theory...</i>

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:30.840
<i>...that humans were able to fly and make rocks float a long time ago.</i>

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:33.910
<i>Just keep making fun of it.</i>

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.930
<i>It will be clarified one day...</i>

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:39.000
<i>...by this.</i>

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:52.240
You've got a nice face.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:57.560
I get an idea of how good someone is by looking
at his face when he is looking at a jet.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:03.330
But the VF-O is different from previous jets.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.710
Will you be able to master it?

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:12.120
Being quiet is okay, but being too quiet will make you unpopular.

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:14.300
Isn't there a single-seat model?

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:21.170
I hate carrying another person. I never want to...

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.190
You don't want to even if it's me?

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:27.190
Edgar. You're alive?

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.590
Welcome aboard the Asuka.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:38.450
Welcome? I thought you were dead.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:42.370
I was slammed into the ocean and had to stay in bed for a while.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.280
Go easy on me, now.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.290
Are you able to backseat me like that?

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:49.340
Just leave it to me.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:54.370
Okay, you two will be joining the Skull Squadron.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:59.180
You will receive training on how to use the VF-O.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.430
Will you be able to follow me?

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:02.640
Yes!

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:06.440
Hey, Shin!

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:13.650
He's a good boy. He's just like the young you.

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:17.610
You must be joking. I wasn't quiet like that.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:22.330
Oh? Who was the one who was blushing when we first met?

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:24.120
That happened a long time ago.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:30.280
Yeah, people change... In a good way, or a bad way.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.120
Yep.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.260
Training area confirmed.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.420
Beginning comparison with the landscape information.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:45.930
Listen up, Shin.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:48.880
Gerwalk and Battloid mode are different from normal fighters.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:53.730
You're going to screw up if you don't check the posture data and fuel.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:55.530
I know.

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:57.150
<i>Skull One to the fledglings.</i>

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.660
<i>Once we enter the training area, we will start a mock battle.</i>

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:02.620
<i>I will be your enemy.</i>

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:04.520
<i>You can all attack me at once!</i>

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.330
<i>Skull Two, roger.</i>

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.620
<i>Three, roger.</i>

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.670
<i>Four, roger.</i>

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:10.080
Five, roger.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.070
Let's go.

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:21.010
Shin, Gerwalk change!

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:22.330
I know.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.190
Shoot!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:41.570
Skull Five! You two have just died.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.030
Why you...!

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:47.410
Shin! Don't get so reckless!

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:58.490
Hey, come on, cherry boy.

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:00.250
Shut up...

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:06.930
Hey, Shin!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.690
Don't lose to the Marine Corps!

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:15.020
All right, I'm not going to go easy on you just because you're a woman.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.010
Do you feel the opponent's heart?

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:23.740
I can't defeat the enemy if I think about their feelings.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.830
No, you can't defeat them because you can't feel it.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:29.580
Shut up!

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:40.420
You don't feel it, that's why you don't understand
the opponent, or yourself.

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.180
Ole!

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:56.090
You need to be aware of where your center of gravity is.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:05.020
Above?

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:18.000
I told you to be careful of the posture data!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:21.510
I didn't become a pilot to crawl on the ground!

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:22.220
<i>Listen up!</i>

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:27.050
<i>From now on, battles are not just about flying in the sky!</i>

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:32.810
You need flexibility like the water to adapt to the changing situations.

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:38.800
Are you trying to kill my cute engine?

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:41.860
Look!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.780
Thanks to you, the ground crew has to pull an all-nighter again!

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:49.850
You lack love in your piloting. Love!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:03.420
Be careful... There's an old saying among pilots...

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:10.510
If you stare at the ocean at night, you'll be
drawn into it regardless of your own will.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.900
I heard that you got a lecture from old man Raizou.

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:30.530
He said someone who is trying to use it to its maximum
capabilities has finally appeared, and he looked happy.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.250
Here.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.790
I thought you're not allowed to drink on this ship.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.510
Geez, what a kid...

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:48.370
You can't fight a war if you're afraid of alcohol!

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:52.810
Lieutenant Kudou...

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:54.000
Yes?

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:57.690
You and Edgar won't be training tomorrow.

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:58.810
What?

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.980
I'm giving you two a special mission.

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.150
A special mission?

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.380
Special mission?

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:29.340
He just wants us to escort his girlfriend.

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:32.220
But that doctor's cute.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.470
Another cutie is here!

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:45.400
We came here under orders from the UN government to ensure the safety of the Mayan inhabitants, and...

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:48.990
We cannot allow... a metal Kadun and a fire Kadun to enter the village.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.250
Are you the village head?

00:16:59.040 --> 00:16:59.900
No.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:04.460
I am the hand led by the wind and the keeper
of the ancient songs and order.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.330
It is also my job to protect the village from Kaduns.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:13.460
This girl must be from the Priestesses of the Wind Clan.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:18.460
I understand. We will camp outside the village.

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:21.980
But we need your approval to station here.

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:27.390
People do not understand a disaster until a real one occurs.

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:34.410
Sara...

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.160
Now, now, now.

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:40.160
We will welcome you if you put your weapons down.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.420
How would you like this as a souvenir?

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:43.670
What, Nutuk?

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:51.420
Geez, why do I have to stay behind?

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.930
Where did Shin go?

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.010
Mao?

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:13.660
Why did you come back...

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:16.530
I made a promise.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.240
You could've broken it.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.070
Also, there was an order.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.630
Okay, together. One, two...

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:43.210
Sara, the wind is blowing.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:46.310
But Mao is...

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:52.780
Oh? You must've misunderstood. The shaking leaf is not Mao, but you.

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:55.320
What? But I...

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:13.340
Look at this machine, it's very similar to the Time Structure Transformation system from the ASS-One remains.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:18.920
Does that mean this thing has gravity control?

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:22.880
It can most likely travel through time and teleport.

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:26.800
What is this thing...?

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.110
What are you planning to do?

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:36.820
Oh, welcome, Hand Led By the Wind.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:41.120
I am doing a blood test of the villagers.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.520
Blood test?

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:46.710
No! I will not allow you to take any blood!

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:47.330
What?

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:51.040
The blood is part of Mayan itself.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:54.300
Are you trying to steal our souls along with our blood?

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:58.430
No, I'm just doing it to check everyone's health...

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:56.120
What's going on?

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:57.750
Sis!

00:19:58.430 --> 00:19:59.340
Be quiet!

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:02.930
You don't know the dreadfulness of impure blood.

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:06.550
Shall I attach a cursed Kadun to you?

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:12.350
To an anthropologist, that would be good experience.

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:17.030
Let it be, Sara.

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:20.780
It's just blood.

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:24.450
What are you talking about, Shin?

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:29.670
There are two snakes entangled with each other
in the blood, and if their power is released...

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:31.500
Two snakes entangled with each other?

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:36.260
Lieutenant Kudou, if you know her, can you try and convince her?

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:38.840
Taking blood is to check everyone's health.

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:41.540
Shin?

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.170
Lieutenant Kudou.

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:54.980
I know, let's let everyone decide.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:55.680
What?

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:59.950
Everyone, which is more important, a rule or your health?

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:06.200
No! Do not break a rule of Mayan!

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:10.320
Attention, everyone!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:17.170
Now, everyone, if you let me draw your
blood, I'll give you this energizing juice!

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:24.720
Me! Me!

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:28.850
This can't be...

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:29.730
Sara...

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:42.320
Are you going to steal the stars?

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:44.740
Sara?

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:51.450
She is going to steal our blood, and now you're
going to take away the light of the stars?

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:53.950
Stars?

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.870
My deceased father told me...

00:21:57.630 --> 00:22:02.510
When there are lights that shine on Earth, an equivalent
amount of stars will be taken from the skies.

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:06.010
So?

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:09.880
Everyone drank the juice.

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.220
And your little sister Mao was the one who wanted electricity.

00:22:15.860 --> 00:22:16.720
Mao?

00:22:26.410 --> 00:22:29.650
See? This is what you call the stars on the Earth.

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:37.030
What have you done...?

00:22:37.380 --> 00:22:39.280
If you don't like it, close your eyes.

00:22:40.010 --> 00:22:42.040
You can enjoy the darkness as much as you want.

00:22:42.550 --> 00:22:44.370
Just like your heart.

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:05.570
The cock needs to be better aligned.

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:07.810
This is as good as the manual allows us to get it.

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:14.660
All you guys have to do is maintain this according to the manual.

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:16.950
But we're the ones who have to trust our lives on it!

00:23:17.880 --> 00:23:21.700
But there are many other jets that need maintenance.

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:26.410
How does it feel to have someone hold your life in her hand?

00:23:27.390 --> 00:23:29.670
That's not nice, Nora.

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:31.810
DD!

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:33.550
I've got new information.

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:36.940
The UN Force has pulled <i>it</i> up.

00:23:36.940 --> 00:23:38.190
Finally...

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:41.340
So?  How did it perform as your dance partner...?

00:23:41.780 --> 00:23:43.780
The UN Force's new-type, that is.

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:48.240
It's just the transformation system that they stole from us.

00:23:48.240 --> 00:23:49.620
They're not a threat.

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:53.980
From their "united" perspective, they didn't steal it.

00:23:54.500 --> 00:23:59.740
All technology must be announced to the public
regardless of the country's interests.

00:24:01.840 --> 00:24:06.050
I'll give them this for that nonsense.

00:24:07.180 --> 00:24:08.430
That's good.

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:23.900
I think that searching for the missing pieces of the AFOS
is more important than analyzing the islander's genes.

00:24:23.900 --> 00:24:25.320
Perhaps.

00:24:34.450 --> 00:24:36.480
<i>Roy, are you awake?</i>

00:24:37.830 --> 00:24:39.650
Can't sleep?

00:24:40.330 --> 00:24:41.650
<i>Something like that.</i>

00:24:43.090 --> 00:24:47.490
Go to sleep. You don't know when the enemy will attack.

00:24:49.720 --> 00:24:52.330
If I'm attacked by the enemy, will you protect me?

00:24:53.510 --> 00:24:54.540
<i>Of course.</i>

00:24:57.890 --> 00:24:59.310
I can't rely on that.

00:25:01.190 --> 00:25:02.810
<i>It looks like you don't trust me.</i>

00:25:09.910 --> 00:25:10.860
Flying fish.

00:25:14.570 --> 00:25:16.990
They're the fish who got the same disease as you, Roy.

00:25:19.370 --> 00:25:21.580
<i>The disease that makes you want to fly?</i>

00:25:21.580 --> 00:25:24.670
People made fun of me in college for it.

00:25:24.670 --> 00:25:28.670
Because you only talked about the sky when we were together.

00:25:30.130 --> 00:25:31.200
Maybe.

00:25:32.260 --> 00:25:33.160
<i>Hey...</i>

00:25:34.100 --> 00:25:36.580
<i>I wanted to ask you something from before...</i>

00:25:38.430 --> 00:25:40.800
Why are you here?

00:25:42.480 --> 00:25:44.810
<i>You hated war so much.</i>

00:25:48.320 --> 00:25:50.570
<i>Do you remember Michael?</i>

00:25:50.570 --> 00:25:51.570
Yes.

00:25:51.570 --> 00:25:56.230
<i>He died in the first bombing.</i>

00:25:56.950 --> 00:25:59.820
<i>It was five minutes after we parted.</i>

00:26:02.290 --> 00:26:03.280
I see.

00:26:04.790 --> 00:26:06.840
<i>It's not logic.</i>

00:26:14.640 --> 00:26:15.460
<i>Good night.</i>

00:26:15.970 --> 00:26:17.040
Good night.

00:26:36.530 --> 00:26:37.560
What is it?

00:26:40.540 --> 00:26:41.320
Edgar.

00:26:42.870 --> 00:26:44.830
American burger...

00:26:45.210 --> 00:26:45.950
Geez...

00:27:29.920 --> 00:27:36.010
Dans le calme du soir

00:27:29.920 --> 00:27:36.010
In the calm of the evening...

00:27:36.010 --> 00:27:42.270
Lève les yeux afin du voir

00:27:36.010 --> 00:27:42.270
Raise your eyes to see...

00:27:42.270 --> 00:27:48.310
Apparaître et scintiller

00:27:42.270 --> 00:27:48.310
Appearing and shining...

00:27:48.310 --> 00:27:56.220
Toutes les étoiles

00:27:48.310 --> 00:27:56.220
All the stars.

00:27:58.530 --> 00:28:09.920
Dans leur repos brillent leur coeurs

00:27:58.530 --> 00:28:09.920
In their rest their hearts shine...

00:28:09.920 --> 00:28:20.550
Et leur dire "la terre sera malade"

00:28:09.920 --> 00:28:20.550
And their words 'the world will be ill'...

00:28:15.470 --> 00:28:20.550
The cells are... getting active?

00:28:21.470 --> 00:28:32.730
Ainsi la mer refletera

00:28:21.470 --> 00:28:32.730
And there will be reflections in the sea...

00:28:32.730 --> 00:28:43.330
Qui s'élève la finir sera les hommes

00:28:32.730 --> 00:28:43.330
And those who can rise to end it will be men.

00:28:34.230 --> 00:28:35.430
The flowers...?

00:28:43.330 --> 00:28:49.290
Dans le calme du soir

00:28:43.330 --> 00:28:49.290
In the calm of the evening...

00:28:49.290 --> 00:28:55.670
Lève les yeux afin du voir

00:28:49.290 --> 00:28:55.670
Raise your eyes to see...

00:28:55.670 --> 00:29:01.930
Apparaître et scintiller

00:28:55.670 --> 00:29:01.930
Appearing and shining...

00:28:59.630 --> 00:29:00.840
Sara...

00:29:01.930 --> 00:29:11.550
Toutes les étoiles

00:29:01.930 --> 00:29:11.550
All the stars.
